  - message: Not a bad idea at all. The next rule
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 3
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 600, y: 0}
  - message: 'ule 4: You must find the dolls and put them back at the original shrine'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 4
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 900, y: 0}
  - message: 
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: What do you want? Just let me out of this hellhole already.
      nextNode: 13
    - replyText: Whatever it is, bring it on. I'm always ready to handle it.
      nextNode: 5
    nextNode: 0
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1200, y: 0}
  - message: Very good, then listen closely
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 6
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1497.5, y: 92.5}
  - message: Those dolls didn't go anywhere; they are just waiting for someone to
      bring them back
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1805, y: 97.5}
  - message: Some are crying, some are laughing, and some are calling out to you
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2115, y: 107.5}
  - message: The closer you get, the clearer the sound becomes. Collect all 6 of
      them and put them back on the shrine
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2400, y: 110}
  - message: But don't think the shrine will wait for you in the same spot forever
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2697.5, y: 112.5}
  - message: And whenever the person hanging there disappears, do not let it hear
      your breath
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 11
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2992.5, y: 117.5}
  - message: "If it finds you, do not turn away\u2014stare directly at it, even if
      it doesn't stop"
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 12
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3292.5, y: 110}
  - message: 22:00 - 22:40, may your breath last long enough
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3602.5, y: 90}
  - message: The shrine has been empty all night. The missing offerings are crying
      out around you
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 14
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1515, y: -65}
  - message: Listen carefully, bring them all back, and remember that your breathing
      is louder than you think.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 15
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
